Kalanos Tracking
Copyright 2026 Kalanos AI

This package reads a Kalanos assessment through the Kalanos report loader (Apache-2.0,
published on PyPI as a pinned dependency; its source code is not copied here) and writes
selected fields to experiment trackers you already use. The tracker libraries are optional
dependencies and keep their own licenses, trademarks and attribution.

